Apollo MLED-1 firmware

This is a modified version of WLED (https://github.com/wled/WLED), currently based on
WLED 16.0.1, modified by Apollo Automation starting 2026-11-13. It is not an official
WLED release.

WLED is licensed under the European Union Public Licence v. 1.2 or later (EUPL); see
LICENSE. Apollo's modifications are distributed under EUPL-1.2. All upstream copyright
notices are retained. Third-party libraries keep their own licences.

The Apollo changes are the difference between this repository's main branch and the most
recently merged upstream WLED release tag (initially v16.0.1, commit 29b389df).
